{
  "feature": "Social R1 PR E: the pods table on /friends (E1) and its header menu (E2) (handoff design_handoff_the99_social_r1 R2, R2 - Pods option B; plan 2026-10-15-social-r1.md, PR E)",
  "note": "Needs SOCIAL_FRIENDS_ENABLED=true for the reader, and fixtures: the reader's friends Dave (Atraxa), Priya (no commander), Alex (Ghalta) and Zed (Krenko); a pod the reader owns with Dave, Priya and Alex; a pod Sam (not the reader's friend) owns with the reader and Dave, its spares shared; and a pod of the reader alone. The rows write nothing (the Add dialog, the create field, the rename field and the confirms are opened, never confirmed), but the fixtures are social rows: plant them on a scratch branch off local-dev ONLY. The empty state, the failure toasts and the Add empties are held by pods-pane.test.tsx. The menu's keyboard, rename's commits and reverts, and every confirm's outcome are held by pod-menu.test.tsx.",
  "shares": {
    "module": "src/components/social/social-toast.tsx",
    "binding": "SocialToast",
    "note": "A pod write that fails is the social screens' one toast (E15)."
  },
  "out": "contact-sheets/social-r1-pods",
  "rows": [
    {
      "id": "table",
      "label": "Pods: the table, three a row at 390 and five at 1300; you outlined, the owner's ✕, + Add friends, the tags, the solo line and the spares box",
      "view": "src/components/social/pods-pane.tsx",
      "steps": [
        { "goto": "/friends", "wait": "[data-testid=pod-card]", "settle": 1500 },
        { "scrollTo": "[data-testid=pods-pane]", "settle": 600 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "add",
      "label": "Pods: + Add friends open on the reader's pod, the friends not yet in it with their faces, nothing ticked",
      "view": "src/components/social/pods-pane.tsx",
      "steps": [
        { "goto": "/friends", "wait": "[data-testid=pod-card]", "settle": 1500 },
        { "clickRole": "button", "name": "^\\+ Add friends$", "wait": "[role=dialog]", "settle": 800 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "create",
      "label": "Pods: New pod pressed, the inline name field over the list",
      "view": "src/components/social/pods-pane.tsx",
      "steps": [
        { "goto": "/friends", "wait": "[data-testid=pod-card]", "settle": 1500 },
        { "clickRole": "button", "name": "^New pod$", "wait": "#pod-new-name", "settle": 600 },
        { "scrollTo": "[data-testid=pods-pane]", "settle": 400 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "menu-owner",
